Place 5 into values.
Place 6 into values.
Place 7 into values.
Keep a shared lefts as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 1 into lefts.
Place 3 into lefts.
Place 5 into lefts.
Place -1 into lefts.
Place -1 into lefts.
Place -1 into lefts.
Place -1 into lefts.
