The nexts is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 6, Place -1 into nexts.
The queue is an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 0 into queue.
The head is 0.
The count is 1.
The remaining is 1.
The nextcount is 0.
The previous is -1.
Repeat while head is less than count.
The node is item head of queue.
Add 1 to head.
If previous is at least 0, set item previous of nexts to node.
Set previous to node.
If item node of lefts is at least 0, Place item node of lefts into queue, add 1 to count, add 1 to nextcount.
If item node of rights is at least 0, Place item node of rights into queue, add 1 to count, add 1 to nextcount.
Subtract 1 from remaining.
If remaining is 0, set previous to -1, set remaining to nextcount, set nextcount to 0.

For every node from 0 to 6.
The line is format whole number item node of values as text.
Place " " into line.
The next is item node of nexts.
If next is at least 0, Place format whole number item next of values as text into line, otherwise Place "-1" into line.
Show line.
